{"id":"636442","name":"琥珀核桃","author":"森林小花熊_lZQJ","authorId":"10793829","desc":"","cover":"images/636442/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"核桃","amount":"300g"},{"name":"糖","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"100g"},{"name":"小苏打","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"清水煮核桃仁同时加入小苏打。","img":"images/636442/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"开锅需要再煮2到3分钟，过清水清洗。","img":"images/636442/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗干净空水。","img":"images/636442/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"糖和水下锅中火熬。","img":"images/636442/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"熬到水分下去起大泡。","img":"images/636442/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下核桃仁小火翻炒，把水分炒干后待用。","img":"images/636442/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"凉油把核桃仁加入一起小火翻炒到金黄取出。","img":"images/636442/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"趁热撒黑芝麻或者白芝麻，冷却即可。","img":"images/636442/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}